{
  "$comment": "The repository work board's data (plan/RULES.md §5), generated by plan/scripts/board.js; this file only documents the shape. status: landed | complete | building | planning | halted | escalated | abandoned | next | not-started | no-board. complete: a unit whose run passed qa and has not merged. next: the unit a tracking board names in wip.next, never active; it carries next: true and blockedBy, the blockers that have not landed. Paths are relative to docs/plans/. system on a row without a board, and on an unscheduled issue, is set by the presenter once and kept by board.js. reconciliation: the impact's reconciliation state of the row's board, derived by board.js from it (plan/scripts/lib.js reconciliation(); plan/RULES.md §2, Impact), never stored on a board: { state: planned | partial | as-built, landed, total }, landed and total the units landed of all on a tracking issue's row (null on an issue's), or null while the board records no impact or the row has no board of its own.",
  "schema": "work-board/1",
  "repo": "<owner/name>",
  "generated": "<ISO date-time>",
  "asOf": "<YYYY-MM-DD>",
  "tree": {
    "ref": "<branch>",
    "sha": "<sha>"
  },
  "systems": [
    {
      "slug": "<registry slug>",
      "name": "<name>",
      "slot": 1,
      "top": "<top-level system>",
      "status": "built",
      "board": null
    }
  ],
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "<tracking issue number>",
      "issue": 0,
      "title": "<tracking issue title>",
      "board": "<NN-slug/dashboard.html>"
    },
    {
      "key": "other",
